==English==

===Etymology===
From the act of putting a (pre-decimal) penny in the slot of a pay-toilet cubicle.

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|en|En-au-spend a penny.ogg|Audio (AU)}}

===Verb===
{{en-verb|[[spend]]<,,spent> a [[penny]]}}

